  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Senegal Extractive Industries Transparency Initiative Implementation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the grant is to support the National EITI Committee of Senegal in its implementation of EITI by producing a first EITI reconciliation report before October 2015. The intermediate objectives will include (i) development of a complete organizational framework for the national EITI committee, its sub-committees and the supporting Secretariat, and (ii) the development of a comprehensive outreach and communication campaign which meets the needs of government as well as outreach to civil society stakeholdersin Dakar, regional centers, and local communities which are directly impacted by oil, gas and mining operations.</narrative>
  </description>
